cff-version: 1.2.0
title: The Voynich Transliteration Tool (TVTT)
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Krymorn
    alias: cmarbel
repository-code: https://github.com/Krymorn/The-Voynich-Transliteration-Tool
url: https://github.com/Krymorn/The-Voynich-Transliteration-Tool
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-28
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Voynich Manuscript
  - cryptanalysis
